  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061x\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x=\\operatorname{sin}\u20612x\n$$\n\n \n\nSubstituting $x={28}^{\u2218}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061{28}^{\u2218}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061{28}^{\u2218}=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(2\\cdot {28}^{\u2218})=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061{56}^{\u2218}.\n$$",
